---
/*
 * Popup was never a component: it was `Popover.bare` under a second name, with its own page. The
 * section merged into Popover's, so this route keeps working as a 301 onto that heading. Same
 * treatment as `components/details.astro`, which redirects into Accordion.
 */
return Astro.redirect("/components/popover#popup", 301);
